  "body": "Complete separately reviewed county participation context query, including the native Susquehanna whole-county registered-voter fraction. Preserves every previous source record, contextual join, exclusion, missing value and complete contextual geometry. Includes 1,228 source records, 744 county observations, 357 usable rates and 387 missing rates across 18 jurisdictions. Contextual 2024 geometry is not certified 2026 election reporting geography. Complete archive contains all 31 numerical/source/geometry/reproduction members. This release does not itself deploy the UI."
